- `%ProgramData%\XinSpect\Audit\audit.json` (audit log);
- `%ProgramData%\XinSpect\Driver\` (only if deep access was enabled);
- `%LOCALAPPDATA%\XinSpect\` (bridge extraction and the WebView2 profile).


